<h2 tabindex="0" class="rug-accordion--toggle js--analytics" data-category="waarom-accordion" data-label="Informatica" data-action="bachelor" data-anchor="why">
<span class="rug-icon"></span><span class="rug-accordion--toggle-label">Why study this programme in Groningen?</span>
</h2>
<div class="rug-accordion--content">
<a id="why"></a>
<div>
<div>
                           
<p>&bull; Comprehensive curriculum covering all major knowledge
areas in Computing Science</p>
                           
<p>&bull; Creative freedom in projects and practicals</p>
                           
<p>&bull; Small-scale, personal environment for quick connections
with fellow students and professors</p>
                           
<p>&bull; Cross-disciplinary research opportunities in fields like
bioinformatics, medicine, and astronomy</p>
                           
<p>&bull; Flexible combinations with other subject areas, such as
through a Minor</p>
                           
<p>&bull; Vibrant coding community with opportunities to represent
the university in national an</p>
                        
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-accordion--part">
