<div class="rug-accordion--part">
<h2 tabindex="0" class="rug-accordion--toggle js--analytics" data-category="nastudie-accordion" data-label="Informatica" data-action="bachelor" data-anchor="afterstudies">
<span class="rug-icon"></span><span class="rug-accordion--toggle-label">After your studies</span>
</h2>
<div class="rug-accordion--content">
<a id="afterstudies"></a>
<h2>Job prospects</h2>
<div>
<div>
                           
<p>Many of our graduates choose to pursue our MSc in Computing
Science to further specialize or explore new specializations such
as Cybersecurity and AI Engineering, or more established ones such
as Machine Learning and Software Engineering. Our graduates are
also regularly accepted into top MSc programmes both in the
Netherlands and internationally.</p>
                        
</div>
<div>
                           
<p>
                              
<strong>Finding a job after graduation</strong>
                           
</p>
                           
<p>Students who do not continue with a Master's step into dynamic
roles at IT firms, major corporations, public-sector organizations,
hospitals, and educational institutions. Here, they design
cutting-edge software and lead innovative projects, integrating
components&mdash;or even entire systems&mdash;to drive impactful
solutions.<br>
                              
<br>
You'll graduate with strong technical skills and a problem-solving
mindset, ready to tackle challenges, adapt quickly, and design
structured solutions&mdash;no matter what the industry throws at
you.</p>
                        
</div>
</div>
<h2>Job examples</h2>
<ul class="rug-list--bullets rug-mv-xs">
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Data engineer</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Cybersecurity expert</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Software developer</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Software engineer</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Machine learning specialist</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Game developer</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Database administrator</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Data scientist</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Project manager</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-accordion--part">
<h2 tabindex="0" class="rug-accordion--toggle js--analytics" data-category="onderzoek-accordion" data-label="Informatica" data-action="bachelor" data-anchor="research">
<span class="rug-icon"></span><span class="rug-accordion--toggle-label">Research</span>
</h2>
<div class="rug-accordion--content">
<a id="research"></a>
<div>
<h3>Our Bachelor's degree programme in computing science is connected to the Bernoulli Institute.</h3>
<langContainer></langContainer>
<div>
                           
<p>The mission of the <a href="/research/bernoulli/">Bernoulli
Institute</a> is to perform outstanding academic research and
teaching in Mathematics, Computer Science, and Artificial
Intelligence, and to maintain international leadership herein; to
foster these disciplines as a living body of knowledge, and to make
it relevant to society in its broadest sense. The symbiosis between
pure and applied science, and between mono- and multidisciplinary
research and teaching, is a distinguishing characteristic of our
institute. As an important part of this mission we aim to transfer
our results to other areas of science and technology, and initiate
and expand inter- and multi-disciplinary research
collaborations.</p>
                           
<p>The following research groups within the institute focus on
computing science:</p>
                           
<ul class="rug-list--bullets rug-mv-xs">
                              
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
                                 
<span>
                                    <a href="/research/bernoulli/groups/computer-architecture/">C</a>
                                 </span>
                                 <a href="/research/bernoulli/groups/computer-architecture/">omputer
Architecture</a>
                              
</li>
                              
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
                                 
<a href="/research/bernoulli/groups/ds/">
                                    <span>Distributed
Systems</span>
                                 </a>
                              
</li>
                              
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
                                 
<a href="/research/bernoulli/groups/fundamental-computing/">
                                    <span>Fundamental
Computing</span>
                                 </a>
                              
</li>
                              
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
                                 
<a href="/research/bernoulli/groups/information-systems/">
                                    <span>Information
Systems</span>
                                 </a>
                              
</li>
                              
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
                                 
<a href="/research/bernoulli/groups/intelligent-systems/">
                                    <span>Intelligent
Systems</span>
                                 </a>
                              
</li>
                              
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
                                 
<a href="/research/bernoulli/groups/svcg/">
                                    <span>Scientific
Visualization and Computer Graphics</span>
                                 </a>
                              
</li>
                              
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
                                 
<a href="/research/bernoulli/groups/software-engineering/">
                                    <span>Software
Engineering and Architecture</span>
                                 </a>
                              
</li>
                           
</ul>
                        
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
